    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]REGIMENTAL COMMAND - CHINOOK 91 GSO STATION[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - New Varadero AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"New Varadero is an active Latin American Colonial Navy (LACN) military outpost located on the outer rim."}

    {"Seismic and visual satellite tracking confirm that a non-terrestrial craft crash-landed at the site four days ago."}

    {"Contact with the garrison was lost shortly thereafter."}

    {"Your mission is to assess the situation and restore control."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish Forward Operating Base near the northern perimeter of the LACN command post."}
    {"[bullet]Secure the crash site and assess the nature and threat of the vessel. Unknown hostile presence likely."}
    {"[bullet]Locate any LACN survivors and render aid."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Prevent looting or tampering with alien tech by UNMC personnel."}
    {"[bullet]Isolate the vessel from power or signal transmission pathways."}
    {"[bullet]Eliminate any confirmed hostile xenoforms or non-human entities."}

    {"Expect resistance. Expect irregularities."}
    {"Use your best judgment in an unconventional AO."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
