    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - New Varadero AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"New Varadero has become a liability."}

    {"A xenoform spacecraft has crash-landed near the Latin American Colonial Navy base. Predictably, LACN personnel were overrun or compromised."}

    {"You are to enter this AO with full authority and suppress all threats, regardless of flag or origin."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish fortified FOB overseeing the crash site and garrison compound."}
    {"[bullet]Terminate all active non-human combatants."}
    {"[bullet]Seize the alien vessel and destroy any hostile or uncooperative LACN holdouts."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Disable surveillance and transmitter towers to prevent civilian footage leaks."}
    {"[bullet]Purge local biosigns in surrounding jungle and cave systems."}
    {"[bullet]Collect proof of foreign tampering or weapons trafficking through the site."}

    {"[underline]This is not a rescue. This is a lockdown.[/underline]"}
    {"Let the wreckage tell no stories."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
