    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - New Varadero AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"A crash of an apparent extraterrestrial vessel near New Varadero triggered a full communications blackout."}

    {"While local records confirm the presence of at least one non-human entity, the political situation with the Latin American Colonial Navy must be treated with the utmost diplomatic care."}

    {"Avoid escalation. Seek survivors. Do not allow a rescue to become an incident."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy FOB at a secure location, taking care not to disturb LACN fortifications."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and secure LACN personnel in medbay, barracks, or command center. Prioritize cooperation."}
    {"[bullet]Secure and shield any civilians exposed to the alien vessel or its occupants."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Open communication with remaining LACN officers if possible. De-escalate."}
    {"[bullet]Minimize destruction of local structures and infrastructure."}
    {"[bullet]Prevent technology or biological contamination from affecting the wider colony."}

    {"This is not about conquest, it's about responsibility."}
    {"[underline]Show them what integrity looks like.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
