    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - New Varadero AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"We have confirmation that a highly advanced extraterrestrial spacecraft has crash-landed at New Varadero, an LACN outpost."}

    {"You are ordered to recover alien technology, biological traces, and environmental data intact and uncompromised."}

    {"Time is limited. Every other power will want what lies in that wreck."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy FOB at a location which provides a clear route to the vessel and LACN tech bunkers."}
    {"[bullet]Recover as much intact alien material (armor, tools, DNA, recordings) as possible."}
    {"[bullet]Secure blacksite data servers within the LACN command structure and flag all contact logs."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Avoid structural damage to the vessel. Document its propulsion, hull, and weapons systems."}
    {"[bullet]Track non-human movements using biometric trace systems left in caves or power conduits."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve jungle biome as evidence of any non-human interference."}

    {"Bring back proof. Bring back brilliance."}
    {"Bring back [bold]everything[/bold]."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

